        },
        {
          "text": "Nee Yosefu kudá' ya/abuuse aa beér Barnaba (gídaabárós a heé gurkwa/asa ga xuú'), inós a heé tlahhoó Laáwi, nee yaamaá i dahhi a yaamaá Kipro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
